<SiteLayout title="Booking Simple KH Privacy Policy" description="Privacy Policy for Booking Simple KH.">
<section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap"><span class="eyebrow">App Privacy</span><h1>Booking Simple KH Privacy Policy</h1><p>Pre-release privacy information for Booking Simple KH.</p></div></section>
<section class="content"><div class="wrap prose"><p><strong>Last updated: August 20, 2026</strong></p><p><strong>Status: Pre-release draft.</strong> This policy will be reviewed against the final app implementation before publication on Google Play.</p><h2>1. Scope</h2><p>This Privacy Policy applies to Booking Simple KH, a Kroma Digital application for simple booking and appointment management.</p><h2>2. Data handling</h2><p>The final data-handling behavior will depend on the released version. Before release, Kroma Digital will verify how booking details, customer names or contact information, schedules, notes, and related business data are stored and whether any information is transmitted off-device.</p><h2>3. Notifications and permissions</h2><p>If the app uses notifications, calendar access, contacts, phone features, messaging links, or other Android permissions, those permissions and their purposes will be documented here before release.</p><h2>4. Third-party services</h2><p>If the released app uses analytics, crash reporting, billing, advertising, cloud services, messaging, or other third-party SDKs, this policy will identify those services and explain their role.</p><h2>5. Data retention and deletion</h2><p>The final release policy will explain how booking-related data is retained and how users can delete records or request deletion where applicable.</p><h2>6. Security</h2><p>Kroma Digital will use reasonable safeguards appropriate to the final implementation and the sensitivity of any customer or business information processed by the app.</p><h2>7. Changes</h2><p>This pre-release policy may change during development. The version published at this URL when the app is released will reflect the final implementation.</p><h2>8. Contact</h2><p>Privacy questions can be sent through the Kroma Digital Facebook page linked on our <a href="/contact">Contact page</a>.</p></div></section>
</SiteLayout>